6. Platform components used through packages
--------------------------------------------

- Android, code scanner (mobile_scanner): Google ML Kit Barcode Scanning
  (com.google.mlkit:barcode-scanning or Google Play services). Proprietary,
  subject to the Google ML Kit Terms of Service
  (https://developers.google.com/ml-kit/terms). Not open source.
- iOS/macOS, code scanner (mobile_scanner): Apple Vision / AVFoundation
  (system frameworks).
- Windows/Linux, printing (printing): PDFium binaries
  (https://github.com/bblanchon/pdfium-binaries), downloaded at build
  time; PDFium is licensed under BSD-3-Clause / Apache-2.0.
- Linux, secure storage (flutter_secure_storage): libsecret (system
  library, LGPL-2.1-or-later).


